            "content": [
              {
                "text": "The Consumer Price Index for All Urban Consumers rose 0.1 percent on a seasonally adjusted basis after falling 0.4 percent in June. Over the 12 months ending in July, the all-items index increased 3.4 percent, following a 3.5 percent rise for the period ending in June. ",
